# Which spaces are in Compartment B? (useful when a fire starts there)
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX ftl:  <https://example.org/firetwin#>
PREFIX b:    <https://example.org/firetwin/building#>
SELECT ?label WHERE { ?space ftl:inCompartment b:CompB ; rdfs:label ?label . }
ORDER BY ?label
